            "media_type": "review",
            "stars": "5",
            "title": "<p><strong>I love this spray!...</strong></p>",
            "review": "<p>I love this spray! I have very sensitive skin that reacts to many ingredients that are hypoallergenic. It makes finding sunscreens very difficult. This spray on, I have no adverse reactions and it feels great! No sticky feeling or feeling like I've put on extra layers.</p>",
