          "settings": {
            "category": "ATHLETE TESTED",
            "media_type": "review",
            "stars": "5",
            "title": "<p><strong>Worth it!</strong></p>",
            "review": "<p>I’m a 56 year old lifelong surfer and 50spf is a great product.  I’ve tried many different sunscreens throughout the years and this is by far one of the best.  I’m typically in the water for about an hour per session and I put in a pretty thick coat and it’s kept me from being sunburned.  It’s now my go too…stoked on it.</p>",
